cters and enjoy events\u266a<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510830/extras/9ef40675e2b5beeaab3944781f8afad0.avif?t=1733273337\" /></span><br><br>Each character also has various costumes!<br>Put on different outfits and walk around the town, look for events with NPCs......",
